ry file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/external/test_structured_output_matrix.py:1-22, 49-53` — Preserve live-call-only responsibility, matrix dimensions, production-shaped prompts, and deterministic scorer delegation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/external/test_verified_fake_contract_live.py:1-18` — Preserve execution of the same shape contract against the real client. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/external/test_workflow_live.py:1-15, 91-98` — Preserve real-agent workflow path and missing-prompt-variable blind-spot guard. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest --collect-only tests/external/test_structured_output_matrix.py tests/external/test_verified_fake_contract_live.py tests/external/test_workflow_live.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/external/test_structured_output_matrix.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/external/test_verified_fake_contract_live.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/external/test_workflow_live.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2d43-3c39-307e-4450"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"3187-eae2-a522-43cd","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/external — cohort 02: structured_output_matrix–workflow_live","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["4af91b05-43c3-4ef1-abd4-cf164191746b","3574a45e-03af-4b83-85ef-65ad73184758","04a7e5bc-2be6-4f52-b573-dc50c9204005","cc870e6e-3a38-45d4-880a-574fb2111e13","f8cfa027-6fa3-4a39-986b-fd6cb81c0683"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788582545626957001,"uuid":"faccf4e6-07db-48a8-ba8b-a1fd938556f1"}